& v=r w=r \frac{2 \pi}{T}
\end{aligned}$
Hence, $\quad \frac{2 r \pi}{T} \geq \sqrt{r g} \begin{aligned}
T & \leq \frac{2 \pi r}{\sqrt{r g}}=2 \pi \sqrt{\frac{r}{g}}=2 \pi \sqrt{\frac{4}{9.8}} \\
